.TH "pw-mididump" 1 "1.6.8" "PipeWire" \" -*- nroff -*-
.ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pw-mididump \- The PipeWire MIDI dump

.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpw-mididump\fP [\fIoptions\fP] [\fIFILE\fP]

.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP

.PP
Dump MIDI messages to stdout\&.

.PP
When a MIDI file is given, the events inside the file are printed\&.

.PP
When no file is given, \fBpw-mididump\fP creates a PipeWire MIDI input stream and will print all MIDI events received on the port to stdout\&.

.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP

.PP
\fB-r | --remote=NAME\fP
.RS 4
The name the remote instance to monitor\&. If left unspecified, a connection is made to the default PipeWire instance\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-h | --help\fP
.RS 4
Show help\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB--version\fP
.RS 4
Show version information\&.
.RE
.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP

.PP
The PipeWire Developers <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/issues>; PipeWire is available from <https://pipewire.org>

.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire(1)\fP, \fBpw-cat(1)\fP 

